 {
  "coord": "13:7",
  "verdict": "FAIL",
  "category": "grammar",
  "note": "\"look on uncertain\" is ungrammatical for \"Incertain lookers-on\".",
  "replacement": "DION. If you would not, you have no pity for the state, nor for the memory of his most sovereign name. You give little thought to what dangers, through his highness's failure to have a child, may fall on his kingdom and devour the uncertain onlookers. What could be more holy than to rejoice that the former queen is at peace? What holier than, for the repair of the royal line, for present comfort and for future good, to bless the bed of majesty again with a sweet partner to it?"
 },
